Description: CUEMS Editor - Collaborative Universal Edit Management System
 CUEMS Editor provides a WebSocket-based server for collaborative
 editing and project management. It includes modules for database
 management, media handling, and project organization.
 .
 This package installs into the /usr/lib/cuems/ virtual environment
 provided by cuems-utils. Console scripts are installed to
 /usr/lib/cuems/bin/cuems-editor and /usr/lib/cuems/bin/cuems-ws-server.
 .
 The systemd service file is provided by cuems-common and runs the
 cuems-ws-server console script.
